%% Account deletion lifecycle - ADR-019, SET-FR-004/005, BR-009, PRIV-007
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> UNVERIFIED: register AUTH-FR-001
    UNVERIFIED --> ACTIVE: OTP verified AUTH-FR-002
    UNVERIFIED --> [*]: 24h expiry EDGE-002

    ACTIVE --> SUSPENDED: admin ADMIN-FR-006
    SUSPENDED --> ACTIVE: expiry auto BR-034 / reinstate ADMIN-FR-008
    ACTIVE --> BANNED: admin ADMIN-FR-007
    BANNED --> ACTIVE: reinstate ADMIN-FR-008

    ACTIVE --> PENDING_DELETION: user deletes SET-FR-004
    SUSPENDED --> PENDING_DELETION: allowed BR-008
    PENDING_DELETION --> ACTIVE: login + restore within 30d SET-FR-005
    PENDING_DELETION --> DELETED: day 30 erasure PRIV-007
    DELETED --> [*]

    note right of PENDING_DELETION
      IMMEDIATE on request:
      - all sessions invalidated BR-035
      - profile gone from search, feeds,
        follower lists, suggestions
      - posts and comments REMAIN as Deleted User
      - pending message requests withdrawn EDGE-030
      - identifier reserved, re-registration
        refused and redirected EDGE-029
    end note

    note right of DELETED
      IRREVERSIBLE at day 30:
      - erased: phone, email, DOB, name,
        photo, city, bio, tokens, sessions
      - posts/comments: TEXT KEPT,
        author to anonymous actor BR-009
      - messages: BODY KEPT for counterpart,
        sender anonymised BR-046
        ARCH-CONFLICT-004 - legal review
      - identifier hash to reserved list
      - audit entries retained pseudonymously
    end note

    note left of BANNED
      Banned account cannot log in,
      so it cannot reach the deletion path.
      Identifier hash on banned list
      permanently BR-036, ARCH-CONFLICT-005
    end note
